  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Lobster Skewer.png|left|200px]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 48\n |price = 1 to 417\n |time = 40 minutes\n |source = {{Infoicon|bbqg|bigger|link=BBQ Grill}}\n |xp = 50\n |base = 116\n |dia = 3\n |time3 = 34 minutes\n}}\n'''Lobster skewer''' are [[products]] unlocked at [[level]] 48.\n\nLike all [[products]], they are stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making lobster skewer'''===\n[[File:BBQ Grill.png|150px|left|BBQ Grill]]\nLobster skewer are made in the [[BBQ Grill]].\n\nTo make the lobster skewer, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Lobster Tail.png|75px|Lobster Tail|link=Lobster Tail]]\n|[[File:Chili Pepper.png|75px|Chili Pepper|link=Chili Pepper]]\n|[[File:Honey.png|75px|Honey|link=Honey]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 40 minutes to make one lobster skewer, and 34 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] grill. Each lobster skewer gives players 50 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling lobster skewer'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside shop]]\n* Lobster skewer can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 4,176 {{Infoicon|Coin}} coins for 10 lobster skewers.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make the lobster skewer costs 391 {{Infoicon|Coin}} coins.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 2 lobster skewers per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Hummerspieß\n|es = Brocheta de langosta\n|fr = Brochette de Homard\n|it = Spiedino di aragosta\n|nl = Spiesje met Kreeft\n|no = Hummergrillspyd\n}}\n[[pt-br:Espeto de lagosta]]\n\n[[Category:BBQ Grill Products|8]]\n[[Category:Chili Pepper Products]]\n[[Category:Honey Products]]\n[[Category:Lobster Tail Products]]",
  "wikitextHash": "1c81591afaa1985b808e9c3a8b9c18a8de531d94e100f9069b01085130435441"
